|content1=
* June 9th - '''EYEBALLERS''' reform with a roster consisting of [[JW]], [[flusha]], [[Sapec]], [[SHiNE]], and [[Svedjehed]]. <ref name="2K22">{{cite web|url=https://www.eyeballers.net/post/eyeballers-respawns-jw-and-flusha-to-create-a-new-swedish-powerhouse|title=EYEBALLERS Respawns: JW and flusha To Create a New Swedish Powerhouse|date=2022-06-09|publisher='''EYEBALLERS'''}}</ref>
* July 18th - '''EYEBALLERS''' sign [[slap]] as coach. <ref name="+slap">{{cite web|url=https://www.eyeballers.net/post/eyeballers-sign-slap-as-new-head-coach|title=EYEBALLERS Sign Slap as New Head Coach|date=2022-07-18|publisher='''EYEBALLERS'''}}</ref>
* December 20th - '''EYEBALLERS''' bench [[Svedjehed]] and sign [[Peppzor]]. <ref name="-Svedjehed +Peppzor">{{cite web|url=https://www.eyeballers.net/post/eyeballers-sign-peppzor-im-extremely-happy|title=EYEBALLERS sign Peppzor: ”I’m extremely happy”|date=2022-12-20|publisher='''EYEBALLERS'''}}</ref>
